    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/721d0e6aea7609bd9f46438d89e7abd3.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/721d0e6aea7609bd9f46438d89e7abd3.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/721d0e6aea7609bd9f46438d89e7abd3.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u22c5 Ertugrul of Ulukayin is a 3rd person action-adventure game that takes you into the heart of the Turkish medieval era, set against the stunning landscape of Ahlat. Explore breathtaking landmarks and forge connections with neighboring tribes as you navigate this vibrant world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u22c5 Stand up for the innocent and face the secret order that's seeking to corrupt the land, be ready to fight the Mongols and legendary monsters lurking in the shadows. The adventure continues even in your dreams. Experience Turkish mythology, where dreams can lead you to wisdom or drag you into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/cecfa3939b8b5fd959a940529c13cda8.webp?t=1750935087\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/ebf23b0423f0e42f2e560ec97f318f7c.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/ebf23b0423f0e42f2e560ec97f318f7c.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/ebf23b0423f0e42f2e560ec97f318f7c.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u22c5 Immerse yourself in an action-adventure experience set in the medieval era, where you craft, hunt, battle enemies, and explore nearby tribes while discovering historical landmarks that enrich your journey.   <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/006af72999d5fde7248152602afad601.webp?t=1750935087\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/60411ea47ea6579ef56f3dd97820bc35.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/60411ea47ea6579ef56f3dd97820bc35.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/60411ea47ea6579ef56f3dd97820bc35.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u22c5 Play as Ertugrul, Turgut, and Meryem, each equipped with unique weapons and combat styles. Upgrade all three characters to enhance their skills and combat styles.     <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/99e528dae0218432796054ba26d32f39.webp?t=1750935087\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/9df8f0fe76b3421509dda7e7144d4944.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/9df8f0fe76b3421509dda7e7144d4944.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/9df8f0fe76b3421509dda7e7144d4944.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong> </strong>\u22c5<strong> </strong>Experience vivid dreams that reveal Turkish mythology, find the messages and clues that will aid you in the real world... or will the dream drag you into a nightmare?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/4a7dacae660a86025da0222ac9e9319d.webp?t=1750935087\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/a32d9b188276617b3c5c309803b06054.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/a32d9b188276617b3c5c309803b06054.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/a32d9b188276617b3c5c309803b06054.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u22c5 Restore justice in a land ravaged by conflict. Uncover the secrets behind the corruption plaguing the realm and search for your lost brother amid the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/6195ef5a4a5718ca716d2ee59198af7c.webp?t=1750935087\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/b9dd94725929682724a55950c29730ba.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/b9dd94725929682724a55950c29730ba.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/b9dd94725929682724a55950c29730ba.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u22c5 Explore the steppe life and the fighting spirit of the Turks. In each chapter, witness the evolving gameplay. Save people, defeat enemies, strengthen your Oba and yourself, be the leader your people deserve, and stand against evil. Set goodness free.</p>",
