s behind the corruption plaguing the realm and search for your lost brother amid the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/6195ef5a4a5718ca716d2ee59198af7c.webp?t=1750935087\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/b9dd94725929682724a55950c29730ba.poster.avif?t=1750935087\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/b9dd94725929682724a55950c29730ba.webm?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133520/extras/b9dd94725929682724a55950c29730ba.mp4?t=1750935087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u22c5 Explore the steppe life and the fighting spirit of the Turks. In each chapter, witness the evolving gameplay. Save people, defeat enemies, strengthen your Oba and yourself, be the leader your people deserve, and stand against evil. Set goodness free.</p>",
